flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8617561Z ^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8617745Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8617978Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8618088Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8618642Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8619015Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8619366Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8619513Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8619829Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8619976Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8620258Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8620702Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8621064Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8621377Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8621509Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8621639Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8621836Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8621993Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8622292Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8622399Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8622477Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8622570Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8622813Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
