flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8629630Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8629736Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8629886Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8630223Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8630555Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8630867Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8631089Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8631239Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T15:02:03.8631447Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
